OL,5,G2200 The Doors: Live At The Bowl `68   
OL,6,     FAt the height of their musical    
OL,7,     Fprowess, The Doors perform all    
OL,8,     Ftheir classic hits during their   
OL,9,     Flegendary 1968 concert at the     
OL,10,     FHollywood Bowl.                   
