OL,8,     FELO's Discovery album showcases   
OL,9,     Fhits like Shine a Little Love and 
OL,10,     FDon't Bring Me Down in true 70s   
OL,11,     Fstyle.                            
OL,12,G0130 The Moody Blues Live...           
OL,13,     F... at the Isle of Wight: The     
OL,14,     FEnglish rock band perform songs   
OL,15,     Fincluding Nights In White Satin   
OL,16,     Fand Gypsy to a crowd of 600,000 as
OL,17,     Fthe sun goes down on the legendary
OL,18,     Ffestival of 1970.                 
